00:12.900 --> 00:17.220
And absolutely, because when Evan and the team were designing the API for this,

00:17.360 --> 00:19.880
their goal really is to extend upon what you already know.

00:20.200 --> 00:22.480
So if you have if and else, why not else if?

00:22.760 --> 00:26.600
So in this particular case, let's just go ahead and for sake of,

00:26.600 --> 00:30.200
we're going to do the same thing before this time, characterList.length,

00:30.480 --> 00:34.060
