00:39.580 --> 00:46.120
that's like there are odd characters, which is a punny joke, ha, ha, ha.

00:46.680 --> 00:49.580
Anyways, so it's even right now.

00:49.680 --> 00:51.700
So we add this now and we add another one.

00:52.760 --> 00:55.040
Let's do appa.

00:56.600 --> 00:58.020
Refresh, boom.

00:58.560 --> 01:01.060
So it'll run through all the scenarios and end up at the last one.

01:02.020 --> 01:05.460
So generally speaking, from a performance perspective,

01:05.460 --> 01:09.240
you do probably want to optimize for your most common scenario at the very top

01:09.240 --> 01:10.940
so you don't have view running through everything.

01:11.420 --> 01:16.100
But otherwise, yeah, you can else if as long as you see fit.

01:16.560 --> 01:17.060
